5554145", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1033485702220811_6917860014135126447_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ATcZx9L8J6sQ7kNvwHWcbkT&_nc_oc=Adr9ssVapC5WD1R97aqGHduyXsbMt_wallytzNnJXSbl6luSmD5Pwlt_zGqLjzI2_po&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9hpwwird2rQtuwUbFd8S0TpulscZ7fwX4Z2gyLxDgWzw&oe=6A29740B"}, {"file_name": "New_BowCourse_QuestStore_08.png", "id": "1697048881018586", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499319013_1697048884351919_5531112753064302333_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LPTblUlw-y0Q7kNvwH978p3&_nc_oc=AdprFUuMl6G3GGVOeKcJhFvXF2nmJOL2iWgvwkuumGo7eVRL3Z7gpu0R24mmcIESVc8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9nBHozdhRIONCbguX-n9MJlr-jkCRRtTdBCErHpWIXpA&oe=6A295A2B"}, {"file_name": "New_BowCourse_QuestStore_02.png", "id": "1738622320871891", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827567_1738622324205224_1562867178012633561_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DaWK2oCt2sQQ7kNvwFkWiAq&_nc_oc=AdqpUyVJFPcTTN4iCDLfA_7D4v5CztDJbgCOweiJEPsTZizPt_xOOqMURG7z-_XV2Us&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-f57LPwge5ZoZ-kchnClkQRfb_jlb0eOGo9nSIp8xPDw&oe=6A2974AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BowCourse_Thumbnail.png", "id": "2057677827991603", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393956_2057677831324936_6257418328995593478_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PFLglL1qofoQ7kNvwHWAF-U&_nc_oc=AdrtC8bAuq5tN3M7XlSSMrt49Ts5E5AP7ty6LQcojDs6tCxLc32T4ZSlN434sxN9Er4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8fA1RhhK2fs4vkmrvTCx2_zCRAqmLZ5xEvCi62UnvEPQ&oe=6A2972D2"}, "display_name": "Bow Course - Archery Golf", "keywords": ["sports", "casual", "archery", "multiplayer", "golf"], "long_description": "# Nock your arrow and challenge your friends in archery golf!\n\nMaster realistic arrow physics and challenge your friends for a round in beautiful and challenging 9 target courses. Gain a competitive edge with skillful usage of different arrows, avoid obstacles and utilize shortcuts. The player with the least amount of shots in the end wins!\n{1449951679695905}\n\n**Bow Course's Early Access has two maps, difficulty options and all main game mechanics & features. We aim to add an additional map, character customization and more features during EA. We look forward to hearing your feedback!**\n\n**Main Features**\n* Play solo or challenge your friends in multiplayer\n* Realistic bow handling & arrow physics\n* Versatile courses - Each 9 target course offers several routes and shortcuts that players can tactically use with different arrows\n* Fun and challenging gameplay \u2014 Easy to pick up but offers depth to master\n* Practice at the shooting range in the main hub area\n* Customizable difficulty - choose starting point, wind conditions & more\n* Hone your skills with practice mode\n* Play comfortably with teleport, smooth locomotion and other settings\n{716753251094485}\n\n**Customize your outfit**\n* Choose from variety of clothing\n* Change your eyes and mouth\n* Unlock outfits by playing\n{1388403669037468}\n", "short_description": "# Nock your arrow and challenge your friends in archery golf!\n\nMaster realistic arrow physics and challenge your friends for a round in beautiful and challenging 9 target courses. Gain a competitive edge with skillful usage of different arrows, avoid obstacles and utilize shortcuts. The player with the least amount of shots wins!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://korpigames.com/privacy_policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Korpi Games Oy", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://korpigames.com/contacts", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id"